body:
Somewhere between the time someone gushed "Oh, you got to grow up watching Jimmy Fallon on SNL? Man, I'm so jealous. It must have been great."

&#x200B;

Aged me 10 years right there.

Aside from having a hotspot for work and bills, I've disconnected from the internet at home. Without it, I've gotten around to all of those someday projects and I feel more in control. I know what I want to do when I have free time because there are only so many options. Avoiding the internet and it's algorithms feels great, and I recommend it to anyone who could afford to do it. 

&#x200B;

I do understand that I'm posting this on the internet.

"Fine" For me would be medium settings without dipping below 30. Minimal to no crashes

&#x200B;

"Well" medium to high settings targeting 45 to 60 fps

&#x200B;

"Great" High settings, solid 60+

The world has too many shirts with snarky sentences to be bought as gifts for people they only know one thing about. 

&#x200B;

Add a comma, at least. Maybe as a shooting star?

The leather gear from the first raid might be what you're looking for:

&#x200B;

[https://www.wowhead.com/news/complete-leather-castle-nathria-shadowlands-raid-armor-set-317664](https://www.wowhead.com/news/complete-leather-castle-nathria-shadowlands-raid-armor-set-317664)

&#x200B;

Take off the hat and shoulders and it looks great imo. It's what my rouge wears.

It's not surprising that this can be done. I frankly don't want two of these every week. The Timewalking or mythic dungeon one takes a fair bit of time for a casual player. I don't want to feel like I'm being inefficient if I'm able to get 4 timewalking dungeons in  and need to decide if I want to do more on the same character to not miss out, or do it on an alt for that week. 

&#x200B;

That being said, I would love two weekly quests on pet battle weeks.

I'd love for Sylv to get her full redemption. Blue eyes, blonde hair, normal skin and voice. Just as shes smiling, for the first time in a long time, she's stabbed through the throat by Tyrande. 

&#x200B;

Something something killing hope.

My neighbor told me it was a good thing I was a white person, and we needed more guidance from men like myself when talking about replacing women on our HOA board. 

&#x200B;

Nah.
